-                    <h3>Mountain Report</h3>
-                    <br />
-                    <h4>Updated, December 08 7:12 AM</h4>
-                    <br />
-                    <p class="p1">Turn to this page for the daily mountain report, including a rundown on&nbsp;conditions, news, and events happening at the mountain.&nbsp;To receive the daily snow report straight to your inbox you can subscribe <a href="https://www.saddlebackmaine.com/contact-us/" target="_blank">here</a>.&nbsp;Follow us on Twitter for real-time mountain updates (<a href="https://twitter.com/SaddlebackMaine">@saddlebackmaine</a>).</p>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
-
-<h4 class="p1" style="box-sizing: inherit; font-family: Tablet-Gothic; line-height: 1.1; color: rgb(110, 100, 77); margin: 0px; font-size: 18px;">Weather</h4>
-
-<p class="p2" style="margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p class="p1"><strong>Click below to see live weather feeds from our on-mountain weather stations.</strong></p>
-
-<p class="p1"><a href="https://www.weatherlink.com/embeddablePage/show/9a49cc37130f4a1cbf0064d9a3933113/summary" target="_blank"><strong>Summit</strong></a></p>
-
-<p class="p1"><strong><a href="https://www.weatherlink.com/embeddablePage/show/5a07fabadf274316863d11640a35ff78/summary">Top of the Rangeley Express Quad</a></strong></p>
-
-<p class="p1"><a href="https://www.weatherlink.com/embeddablePage/show/e7dd8ce355a44f2a9717240662bfc2c5/summary" target="_blank"><b>Base </b></a></p>
-
-<h4 class="p2">&nbsp;</h4>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
-
-<h4 class="p2">Mountain Update</h4>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p>Happy Wednesday! We have a midweek boost on the way with developing snow showers later in the day. This is going to be the nice light and fluffy stuff, leaving up to a 2’’ coating on the snow surface our snowmakers and groomers have been working hard to develop. Temps at the base will top out in the 20s, so bundle up.</p>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p>We officially opened the Rangeley Quad yesterday with access to Upper &amp; Lower Grey Ghost. The Rangeley Quad and The South Branch lift will spin today from 9 a.m. to 4 p.m. Stay tuned on Twitter and the mountain report page for further updates on terrain expansion.<br />
-&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p>Stay tuned by following @saddlebackmaine on Twitter and refresh this page for further updates on terrain expansion. Tag us in any of your posts and use the hashtag <strong>#lifeisbetterrighthere</strong>.</p>
-
-<h4 class="p1">&nbsp;</h4>
-
-<h4 class="p1">Tip of the Day</h4>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p>Hey, season pass holders! If you haven’t picked up your season pass, our ticket office is open from 8:00 a.m. to 4 p.m. Midweek is a good time to come grab your pass - the next time you’re at the mountain you can head straight to the lift.&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
-
-<p>- Molly Shaw</p>
-
-<p>&nbsp;</p>
